# CQ3: Which pizzas are spicy? Nobody asserted it: the reasoner puts them under SpicyPizza.
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX pizza: <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-ontology/pizza.owl#>
SELECT ?pizza WHERE {
  ?class rdfs:subClassOf+ pizza:SpicyPizza .
  ?class rdfs:label ?pizza .
} ORDER BY ?pizza
